  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistical Support to UNHCR Verification Exercise in Seven Temporary Shelters in Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM is providing UNHCR with required support to conduct a verification exercise in Temporary Shelters along Thailand-Myanmar border: Ban Mai Nai Soi, Ban Mae Surin, Mae Ra Ma Luang, Mae La Oon, Mae La, Umpiem and Nu Po. These temporary shelters were established in the mid-1980s; though small-scale verifications have taken place in recent years, there is a need to carry out a single large scale verification exercise to gain an updated understanding of the overall population. This information is being provided to UNHCR and is informing large-scale resettlement operations planned in the coming years.</narrative>
  </description>
